# CFS CMS - AI Context & Instructions

This file is for AI assistants working on this project. It provides quick context for picking up work between sessions.

## Quick Context

**Project**: CFS CMS - Centralized Content Management System  
**Tech Stack**: SvelteKit + TypeScript + Cloudflare (Workers, D1, R2)  
**Current Phase**: Phase 0 - Foundation & Planning  
**Last Active**: December 29, 2025

## How to Use This Project

1. **First Time?** Read these in order:
   - [README.md](README.md) - Project overview
   - [PROJECT_CONTEXT.md](PROJECT_CONTEXT.md) - Architecture & decisions
   - [ROADMAP.md](ROADMAP.md) - Phase breakdown
   - [TODO.md](TODO.md) - Current tasks

2. **Returning?** Check:
   - [TODO.md](TODO.md) - What's in progress/next
   - [PROJECT_CONTEXT.md](PROJECT_CONTEXT.md) - Architecture reference
   - Git log - Recent changes
   - VS Code problems panel - Any current issues

3. **Building Features?**
   - Check `/src/lib/types` for data structures
   - Reference `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` for architecture
   - Follow conventions in `docs/COMPONENT_GUIDE.md` (TBD)
   - Look at existing components for patterns

## Key Decision Points

### Tech Stack

- **Framework**: SvelteKit (not Next.js or plain React)
- **Host**: Cloudflare Workers (not traditional Node server)
- **Database**: D1 SQLite (not PostgreSQL)
- **Storage**: R2 object storage (not GCS or S3)
- **Why**: Edge computing + integrated ecosystem + learning goal

### Architecture

- **Components**: Live in `/src/routes` and `/src/lib/components`
- **Business Logic**: Lives in `/src/lib/services`
- **Types**: Centralized in `/src/lib/types`
- **Stores**: Svelte stores in `/src/lib/stores` for state
- **No**: Business logic in components; complex components in routes

### UI Inspiration

- **Google Drive**-like interface
- Sidebar navigation + main content area
- Grid/list view toggle
- Drag & drop folder management
- Tag-based search/filtering

## File Structure Reference

```
/
├── README.md                 ← Project overview
├── PROJECT_CONTEXT.md        ← Architecture & decisions (READ FIRST)
├── ROADMAP.md                ← Phase breakdown & timeline
├── TODO.md                   ← Current tasks & progress
├── .cursorrules              ← AI context (this file pattern)
├── src/
│   ├── routes/               ← Pages & layouts
│   │   ├── +page.svelte
│   │   ├── +layout.svelte
│   │   └── (sections)/       ← Route groups
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── components/       ← Reusable UI components
│   │   ├── services/         ← Business logic & API
│   │   ├── stores/           ← Svelte stores
│   │   ├── types/            ← TypeScript type definitions
│   │   ├── utils/            ← Utilities & helpers
│   │   └── index.ts          ← Barrel export
│   ├── app.html              ← HTML shell
│   └── app.d.ts              ← App type definitions
├── docs/
│   ├── DATABASE.md           ← Schema & models (TBD)
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md       ← System design (TBD)
│   ├── CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md   ← Cloudflare config (TBD)
│   └── DEVELOPMENT.md        ← Dev environment setup (TBD)
└── static/
    └── robots.txt
```

## Development Commands

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start dev server
npm run dev

# Build production
npm run build

# Preview production build
npm run preview

# Type check
npm run check

# Lint
npm run lint

# Format (if configured)
npm run format
```

